$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tmgamfv  LOC_AFTER=?

* Every stack of the machine layer carries the alphabet ` Gamma' ` .

s1::id |- ( K e. ( 0 ..^ 8 ) -> K e. ( 0 ..^ 8 ) )
s2::gammaex |- Gamma' e. _V
s3:s2:a1i |- ( K e. ( 0 ..^ 8 ) -> Gamma' e. _V )
i4::fvconst2g
s5:s3,s1,i4:syl2anc |- ( K e. ( 0 ..^ 8 ) -> ( ( ( 0 ..^ 8 ) X. { Gamma' } ) ` K ) = Gamma' )
s6::df-tmgam |- TMGam = ( ( 0 ..^ 8 ) X. { Gamma' } )
s7:s6:a1i |- ( K e. ( 0 ..^ 8 ) -> TMGam = ( ( 0 ..^ 8 ) X. { Gamma' } ) )
s8:s7:fveq1d |- ( K e. ( 0 ..^ 8 ) -> ( TMGam ` K ) = ( ( ( 0 ..^ 8 ) X. { Gamma' } ) ` K ) )
qed:s8,s5:eqtrd |- ( K e. ( 0 ..^ 8 ) -> ( TMGam ` K ) = Gamma' )
